@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5088
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@orderId = PASTE_ORDER_ID_HERE

### Create an order; use a new key for a different order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: sqlserver-checkout-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### List your orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Paste the created order's id into orderId above
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Cancel an unpaid order; repeating this request is safe
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
